{#
 Detail of the « desk_staff » step of the Année scoute workflow (chantier #930),
 written as the content of the step's Détails dialog. Receives `step`
 (Core\ScoutYear\Step\TransitionStep) and reads only `step.details`,
 `step.pendingMessage` and the step itself; the keys of `step.details` are
 documented on Core\ScoutYear\Step\Check\DeskStaffStepCheck. The points to
 check, the actions and who marked the step are rendered by the page
 around this file, never here. Owned by the step checks (lot E); the page
 and the Détails dialog that include it are not.
#}
{% if step.pendingMessage %}
<div class="alert alert-info small py-2 px-3 mb-2" role="note">{{ step.pendingMessage }}</div>
{% endif %}
{% if step.details.sections is defined %}
    {% if step.details.sections is empty %}
    <p class="small mb-2">Aucune section n'a de membres dans l'import.</p>
    {% else %}
    <div class="table-responsive mb-2">
        <table class="table table-sm small mb-0">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Section</th><th scope="col">Animateurs</th><th scope="col">Responsable</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for section in step.details.sections %}
                <tr>
                    <td>{{ section.label }}</td>
                    <td{% if section.chief_count == 0 and section.anime_count > 0 %} class="text-warning-emphasis"{% endif %}>{{ section.chief_count }}</td>
                    {% if not step.details.responsable_checked %}
                    <td class="text-body-secondary">Non vérifiable</td>
                    {% elseif section.responsable %}
                    <td class="text-success-emphasis"><a href="{{ section.responsable.url }}">{{ section.responsable.name }}</a></td>
                    {% else %}
                    <td class="text-warning-emphasis">Aucun</td>
                    {% endif %}
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <p class="text-body-secondary small mb-2">
        Données de l'import du {{ step.details.imported_at|date_fr }}. Le Staff d'U n'a pas de responsable à
        désigner.
        {% if not step.details.responsable_checked %}Responsable non vérifiable sans le module Trombinoscope : seul « au
        moins un animateur » est vérifié.{% endif %}
    </p>
{% endif %}
